sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant F as 前端
    participant CC as CircleController
    participant CS as CircleServiceImpl
    participant PM as PlanMapper
    participant CMM as CircleMemberMapper
    participant CK as CheckinController
    participant CKS as CheckinServiceImpl
    participant BS as BadgeService
    participant UBM as UserBadgeMapper
    participant BC as BadgeController
    participant PC as PlanController
    participant PS as PlanServiceImpl
    participant AC as AuthController
    participant US as UserServiceImpl
    participant DB as MySQL

    Note over U,DB: ① 创建圈子 + 同事务初始计划
    U->>F: 创建圈子(名称/简介/人数)
    F->>CC: POST /circles
    CC->>CS: createCircle(creatorId,name,desc,maxMembers)
    CS->>DB: INSERT circles (status=1)
    CS->>DB: INSERT circle_members (role=2 创建者)
    CS->>PM: INSERT plans (初始计划固定值, status=0)
    Note over CS,DB: 同一 @Transactional，任一步失败整体回滚
    CS-->>CC: Circle
    CC-->>F: Result.success(circle) (含 memberCount=1)

    Note over U,DB: ② 打卡 + 徽章判定
    U->>F: 宽松打卡面板提交
    F->>CK: POST /checkin {planId?,circleId?,duration,exerciseType,...}
    CK->>CKS: checkin(...)
    CKS->>DB: INSERT checkin_records
    CKS-->>CK: CheckinRecord
    CK->>BS: checkAndUnlock(userId)  (Controller 编排，避免循环依赖)
    BS->>CKS: getUserCheckinStatsMine(userId)
    CKS-->>BS: stats (含 longestStreak/exerciseTypeBreakdown)
    BS->>BS: 遍历 BadgeCode 判定未解锁徽章
    BS->>UBM: selectByUserId(userId) 已有徽章
    BS->>UBM: insertIgnore(新解锁徽章)
    BS-->>CK: [{code,name,icon}]
    CK->>CK: record.setNewlyUnlockedBadges(list)
    CK-->>F: Result.success(record) (data.newlyUnlockedBadges)
    F->>F: 含 first_checkin → showModal 庆祝；否则 toast 解锁徽章

    Note over U,DB: ③ 运动生涯页数据加载
    U->>F: 我的 → 运动生涯
    F->>CKS: GET /checkin/stats/mine (经 CheckinController)
    CKS-->>F: {todayDuration,totalDuration,checkinDays,totalCheckins,currentStreak,completionRate,longestStreak,exerciseTypeBreakdown}
    F->>CKS: GET /checkin/heatmap/mine?days=365
    CKS-->>F: {startDate,endDate,days:[{date,minutes,count}]}
    F->>BC: GET /badges/mine
    BC->>BS: getMyBadges(userId)
    BS->>CKS: getUserCheckinStatsMine(userId)
    BS->>UBM: selectByUserId(userId)
    BS-->>F: [{code,name,icon,conditionText,unlocked,unlockedAt?,progressText}] ×8
    F->>F: 渲染 4宫格 + Heatmap + 次级指标 + 类型分布 + BadgeWall

    Note over U,DB: ④ 个人资料修改（头像/昵称）
    U->>F: 点头像 → ActionSheet(拍照/相册)
    F->>F: chooseImage → compressImage
    F->>DB: uploadFile(name='file') → {url}
    F->>AC: PUT /auth/userinfo {avatarUrl}
    AC->>US: updateUser(userId,null,avatarUrl)
    US->>DB: UPDATE users SET avatar_url
    US-->>AC: User
    AC-->>F: Result.success({userId,openid,nickname,avatarUrl,createdAt})
    F->>F: updateUser(context+storage)

    Note over U,DB: ⑤ 计划编辑（初始计划）
    U->>F: 圈子详情 → 待启动计划卡 → 编辑
    F->>PC: GET /plans/{planId} (预填)
    PC-->>F: Plan (status=0)
    F->>PC: PUT /plans/{planId} (部分字段)
    PC->>PS: updatePlan(planId,userId,req)
    PS->>PS: 校验 isCircleAdmin(role>=1) + status==0
    PS->>DB: UPDATE plans
    PS-->>F: Plan (更新后)
    F->>F: navigateBack + 刷新圈子详情
